eposition is correct in the sentence?\",\\n**I live in London.\"**\\\\\\\\|\\\\\\\\*A: on.**\\\\\\\\|\\\\\\\\*B: at.**\\\\\\\\|\\\\\\\\*C: of.**\\\\\\\\|\\\\\\\\*D: in.\",\n      \"options\": [\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\"],\n      \"answer\": \"D\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 7,\n      \"question\": \"Which verb form is correct in the sentence?\",\\n**I will have dinner at 7 pm.\"**\\\\\\\\|\\\\\\\\*A: having.**\\\\\\\\|\\\\\\\\*B: had.**\\\\\\\\|\\\\\\\\*C: have.**\\\\\\\\|\\\\\\\\*D: will be.\",\n      \"options\": [\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\"],\n      \"answer\": \"C\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 8,\n      \"question\": \"Which word is correct in the sentence?\",\\n**I have a new book.\"**\\\\\\\\|\\\\\\\\*A: new.**\\\\\\\\|\\\\\\\\*B: novel.**\\\\\\\\|\\\\\\\\*C: old.**\\\\\\\\|\\\\\\\\*D: young.\",\n      \"options\": [\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\"],\n      \"answer\": \"A\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 9,\n      \"question\": \"Which preposition is correct in the sentence?\",\\n**I live near a park.\"**\\\\\\\\|\\\\\\\\*A: to.**\\\\\\\\|\\\\\\\\*B: on.**\\\\\\\\|\\\\\\\\*C: of.**\\\\\\\\|\\\\\\\\*D: near.\",\n      \"options\": [\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D]\",\n      \"answer\": \"D\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 10,\n      \"question\": \"Which verb form is correct in the sentence?\",\\n**I went to the store yesterday.\"**\\\\\\\\|\\\\\\\\*A: go.**\\\\\\\\|\\\\\\\\*B: have gone.**\\\\\\\\|\\\\\\\\*C: went.**\\\\\\\\|\\\\\\\\*D: had gone.\",\n      \"options\": [\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D]\",\n      \"answer\": \"C\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Test Cases**:\n\nTo verify the correctness of the solution, you can run the following test cases:\n\n```javascript\nconsole.log(isValidSentence(\"I am going to school.\")); // true\nconsole.log(isValidSentence(\"I see a mouse!\"));        // false (should be \"a\" not \"an\")\nconsole.log(isValidSentence(\"The cat is on the mat.\")); // true\nconsole.log(isValidSentence(\"I ha